# The A1 feature cache: ~345 MB of feature vectors, regenerated by
# `python3 -m lab.a1driver`. Its sha256 is what gets committed, in
# lab/a1cache.meta.json and in the lab/a1builds.jsonl row.
lab/a1cache.jsonl
lab/a2cache.jsonl
# The A2 virtualenv and the vendored cross-encoder artifact. Both are
# reproducible from pinned versions: lab/r01/r01-requirements.txt and
# `python3 -m lab.r1_artifact`, whose sha256 digests ARE committed in
# lab/r0/artifacts/digests.json.
.venv/
lab/r0/artifacts/*/
# ...except the ONE pinned artifact the semantic showcase needs, which is
# Apache-2.0 and is bundled so the showcase runs offline from a clean
# checkout. score_default never reads it.
!lab/r0/artifacts/ms-marco-TinyBERT-L2-v2/
